# After the Hollow Warden falls (Milestone 20a, escape start). Plays when the
# Cathedral reloads after the fight; then the map fades out to the overworld.

spawn frank frank at ~-1,0 facing right
face player left
emote frank note
say Frank: Ha! Down it goes! I wasn't sure you had it in you, knight. Neither was it, by the look of things.
say Frank: Listen - I heard the guards talking. They took three others like you. Souls that still shine clean, the ones the Unraveling can't turn.
say Frank: So Vorath's people lock them away instead. One is held in the Monastery, past the village of Verdance.
emote player !
say Vael: Then we find them. All three of them.
say Frank: Verdance first. You need rest, and I need to see what's left of my stock. Come on - fresh air!
fade out 1
